    "created_at": "2017-11-23T13:47:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-11-23T13:47:44Z",
    "body": "Currently, HTML hooks up dialog to the inert concept directly in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#blocked-by-a-modal-dialog, and not via top layer.\r\n\r\nI think the proper fix here will be to move the language about inertness into the fullscreen standard, so that when something is at the top of the top layer, everything else is inert.",
